  "developer_notes": "Compatibility provenance pins only. Public packages do not include the complete bot runtime or HL2SDK mirror, or re-license their source or assets. Official Bot Improver 1.4.6 release DLL hashes are recorded in cs2_runtime_files.json. The approved 1.4.6 cohort includes matching BotController 0.7.1 native/managed/API files, BotRandomizer, BotAimImprover and BotState; the 1.4.5 variant is retained for explicit upgrades. BotController 0.7.0 remains the standalone fallback. The bundled BotAimImprover 2.1.6-career1 overlay uses the corresponding source in vendor/BotAimImprover and schema lookup for m_pBot on CS2 2000933; the original official runtime folder is preserved."
